rline("  ['3. Personal choice',", "  ['3. LifeMap standard (§27)', 'Applied from the start; nothing to tap. Every figure that is the same for everyone is used straight away and listed.', '\"LifeMap uses {X} ({wording}). Change it if you want to use your own.\" Tag \"Set by LifeMap\". When the customer changes it: tag \"' + M.T_MINE + '\" and the chip \"Back to LifeMap\\'s figure ({X})\".', 'Pay rises, cash, investment and pension growth, tax bands and State Pension in future, how the pension is drawn, pension access age, lump-sum share, share you pay, emergency fund months, years kept as cash, spare-money shares, retirement target multiple and spending share, life-cover share and years, budget split, rent-vs-buy figures, risk-and-return illustration figures'],\n  ['3b. Required personal choice', 'Never filled in for the customer. Blank until chosen: it is one of the four that block results.', 'Retirement age, plan-until age (life expectancy), inflation, and a working partner\\'s retirement age. Tag \"Not chosen yet\", then \"' + M.T_MINE + '\".', 'Retirement age, plan-until age, inflation, partner\\'s retirement age'],")
